  {"type": "text", "id": "comp-4", "x": 80, "y": 832, "text": "GlassTextField —— 无边框圆角输入框（18dp），粘贴链接 / 手动代理地址", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "color": "#16213E", "textAlign": "left"},
  {"type": "text", "id": "comp-5", "x": 80, "y": 876, "text": "IosSegmented —— 玻璃分段控件：代理模式 / 主题模式三段切换，选中项深蓝渐变", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "color": "#16213E", "textAlign": "left"},
  {"type": "text", "id": "comp-6", "x": 80, "y": 920, "text": "IosProgress · 流光进度 —— 渐变填充 + 移动光斑；pct=null 为扫描不确定态", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "color": "#16213E", "textAlign": "left"},
